1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=521 '''Zhu Xun''' 朱巽] [521] He was almost certainly a member of the same lineage as Zhu(1) Mingzhi [526] and Shen(2) Li's [1452] (qv.) son-in-law, Zhu(1) Yanzhi [
2 CONC 3266]. Yanzhi's ancestors were Pengcheng jun Zhu(1), who moved Yangzhou, Tianchang xian. Shen(2) Shi died at an early age and Yanzhi's second wife was the daughter of Wang(2) Dingchen [3983], who has the same generational name as 
2 CONC Wang(2) Yaochen's [1919] brothers and cousins. Sun was the maternal grandfather of Sun(1) Zhangqing [1514]. Sun's daughter was married to Zeng(1) Gongliang's [8136] brother or cousin, Jun [3902] or Gongwang [3908]. One of her sons
2 CONC -in-law was Qiang(1) Zhi [7138]. Qiang Zhi, WJ, 25.4a. XCB, 81.10a; SHY:ZG, 23.5b; Zeng Gong, WJ, 46.8b; DDSL, 117.2a. CBD,  1, 579. — [https://www.geni.com/projects/CBDB-Hartwell-collection/46406 RMH]
