1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=13396 '''Fu Ye''' 傅鄴] [13396] This is the father of Shibi [13397] and probably Guangbi [13398], founders of the two branches of the Shanyin Fu(5) and presumed to 
2 CONC be brothers based on their generational names, address and chronological logic. Ye held office in Taizhou as Tiantai county magistrate, presumbably early in career and at beginning of Five dynasties, and moved to Shanyin--possibly
