2 CONC  praised Han Qi's [630] loyalty and had his zi changed and prefaced by Duanyou's only son Buzhi [13]. There is no indication of his place of residence. Duanyou's son-in-law, Chai Zhu (or Huazhu) (not in dataset), was probably a de
