2 CONC ce of Zhao(1) Taizu [9001] and Taizong [9002] to establish this lineage (qijia) branch of the clan in Daming, Xinxian. His great great grandfather, Dan [8153], was a chief minister of Zhenzong and moved to Kaifeng. In 1144, on a m
2 CONC ission to Jin he was strangled to death by the Jurchen. His nephew, Zun [3985], moved to Suzhou at the beginning of the Southern Song. YLDD, 2367.14a; Lou Yue, WJ, 95.1a-16a; Yuan Xie, 22.1a-4a. CBD, 1, 157-8. — [https://www.geni
