2 CONC )'s [641] and Ju(2)'s [642] nephew, Zhengyan's [635] cousin, Chunyan's [7031] and Cuiyan's [656] brother, Xiaozhou's [646] and Yingzhou's [7231] grandfather and Xie's [647] great grandfather. His wife was a cousin of Fan(2) Zuyu's
2 CONC  [7026] wife. He was Lu(9) Gongbi's [1316] son-in-law (twice: sororate). Wu(3) Anshi's [7094] son, Wu(3) C [4162], married his elder sister. Zhongyan was the father-in-law of Liu(2) Anshi's [7045] son. XCB, 256.13b-14a, 298.3b, 30
2 CONC 8.5b, 414.10a, 419.5b, 429.6a; Han Qi, WJ, 48.7b-9b (wife #1, surname Lu(9), who married him at age 16 and died in 1065 at age 27)--Zhi was her only surviving son; Bi Zhongyou, WJ, 15.1a-17b; SHY:ZG, 65.38a-38b, 66.12b; SHY:SH, 56
2 CONC .21b, 27b-28b. CBD, 5, 4171-2. — [https://www.geni.com/projects/CBDB-Hartwell-collection/46406 RMH]
