2 CONC wife was Qian(1) Duanyi's [3041] daughter, who was also probably a niece of Qian(1) Duanli [150] and of Duanying [151]. His second wife's seventh generation ancestor was Li(2) Chongju [984], whose daughter-in-law was Zhao(1) Taizo
2 CONC ng's [9002] eighth (or 6th) daughter. The mother of his wife, surname Li(2), was Wang(2) Anguo's [7076] daughter. Qiu's daughter by surname Li(2) was Meng(2) Chong's [1363] wife. Han Yuanji, WJ, 22.28a-31b (wife surname Li, who di
2 CONC ed in 1177 at age 74; she was buried in Shangrao, thereby establishing Qiu as the one who moved here); XNYL, 56.4b, 59.5b, 90.3a, 14b, 112.1a-1b, 147.13a, 148.15b, 150.6b, 156.8b, 158.12a, 159.10a-10b, 161.18b; SHY:ZG, 43.106b-107
